    "title": "Rotate - Digital Watch Face",
    "description": "Rotate is a Wear OS watch face, which comes with a unique design, inspired by the Moto 360. So huge shout out to the designers of the watch face!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- 20 Color Themes\r\n- 1 Complication\r\n- 2 Seconds-Styles\r\n- AOD Support\r\n- High Resolution\r\n- Battery Efficient\r\n\r\n\r\nUse the instructions in the mobile app to install the watch face on your smartwatch.\r\n\r\nPlease send all problem reports or help requests to our support address\r\ndesigns.watchface@gmail.com\r\n\r\nRotate - Digital Watch Face is compatible with all Wear OS devices (Wear OS 3+). This includes devices like:\r\n\r\n- Google Pixel Watch 1/2\r\n- Samsung Galaxy Watch 4/5/6 Series\r\n- Montblanc Summit-Serie\r\n- Asus Gen Watch 1, 2, 3\r\n- Nixon Die Mission\r\n- Skagen Falster\r\n- ...\r\n\r\nLuka Kilic,\r\nWatchFace-Designs",
